{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"5425","name":"NH Barcelona Eixample","description":"NH Barcelona Eixample, formerly known as NH Máster, is set in the residential Eixample district. The lively Passeig de Gracia with designer shops and trendy restaurants is only a 15-minute walk away, as are Gaudi's famous Casa Batlló and Casa Milà. Close to the Hospital Clínic metro stop, guests have direct links to the Sagrada Familia Church, Plaza España and the Fira de Barcelona exhibition center. The Sants train station is only two stops away, with direct access to the airport and city surrounding areas. NH Barcelona Eixample has 81 modern soundproof rooms all equipped with air-conditioning and free Wi-Fi. There are three superior rooms and a Junior Suite that has a large terrace and street view. A large breakfast is offered daily with a varied selection of local and international goods. For fresh snacks, a quick drink or some ice-cream, guests can use the self-service 24/7 Open Bar. Around the hotel, guests can find some of the best gastronomical offerings in the city, including lively tapas bars, a-la-carte restaurants and lovely lunch spots. For meetings, there are 2 meeting rooms with capacity for up to 100 people. Coffee breaks and snacks can be arranged by NH Barcelona Eixample staff.","address":"Carrer De Valencia, 105-107","city":"BARCELONA","countryCode":"ES","postalCode":"08011","lat":41.386017,"lng":2.15429,"stars":3,"chain":"NH","giataCode":"47896","phone":"902115116","email":"NHMASTER@NH-HOTELS.COM","website":"http://www.nh-hotels.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/00/005425/005425a_hb_a_001.jpg?20240525125041?20250618200855","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/00/005425/005425a_hb_a_002.jpg?20250401114514?20250618200856","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/00/005425/005425a_hb_a_003_20250903_063156.jpg","category":"exterior","order":